---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy · BobBlob" description="Privacy policy for the BobBlob game by Beemik." accent="#e0468f">
  <section class="doc narrow">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">BobBlob</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated November 12, 2026</p>

      <p>BobBlob is a game made by Beemik for everyone, including children. We keep it simple: there are no accounts, we don't run servers for the game, and we don't collect information about you or your family.</p>

      <h2>Information stored on your device</h2>
      <p>Your best distances, unlocked colours, looks and songs, your settings, and a saved copy of your current run are stored only on your phone or tablet. We never receive them.</p>

      <h2>Ads</h2>
      <p>The game is free and shows ads from Google AdMob. All ad requests are marked as directed at children and limited to G-rated content, so ads are not personalized and are not based on your behavior. The game does not use the Android advertising ID. Google may collect limited device information, such as IP address, to show and measure ads and to prevent fraud. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">how Google uses information from apps that use its services</a>.</p>

      <h2>Internet access</h2>
      <p>The game uses the internet only to load ads. Everything else, including the music, works offline.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. Nothing a player does in the game leaves the device, except as described in the Ads section above.</p>

      <h2>Deleting your data</h2>
      <p>Uninstalling the game, or clearing its storage in Android settings, removes all of its data from that device.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes, we'll update this page and the date at the top.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:support@beemik.com">support@beemik.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
